              "text": "<b>7</b>  <b>allele</b> frequency for tailless (phenotype) increases <b>;</b>",
              "numberedInMs": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "er": [],
        "aiSupplement": {
          "explanation": [
            {
              "text": "Drift is a chance change in allele frequencies and has greater relative effects in small populations. A founder event or bottleneck samples only part of the original gene pool.",
