        },
        "stem": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cheetahs, <i>Acinonyx jubatus</i>, are predatory mammals. They have evolved black spots on their fur, which provide camouflage in their habitats.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 9
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<b> </b> <b> </b> Describe how the spotted fur phenotype of <i>A. jubatas</i> may have evolved through natural selection from a non-spotted ancestor.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "marks": 3,
        "topics": [
