              "text": "<b>1</b>  mutation results in (black) spots (phenotype / allele) <b>; </b>",
              "numberedInMs": false
            },
            {
              "n": 2,
              "text": "<b>2</b>  selection pressure is, ability to catch prey / AW <b>or</b> individuals with spots, have a selective advantage / are selected for <b>; ora</b>",
              "numberedInMs": false
            },
            {
              "n": 3,
              "text": "<b>3</b>  spotted (cheetahs), survive / reproduce <b>; ora</b>",
